  "body": "scroll-start is an emerging [css specification](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scroll-snap-2/#scroll-start) that aims to set the default position of a scroller.\r\n\r\nFor it to work correctly with fieldsets it should be inherited by fieldset's anonymous content box   \r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-fieldset-and-legend-elements\r\n\r\nscroll-start is still in very early stages so I guess changes would not be made to the html spec right away but I'm filing this to track the issue as I think it will surface eventually.\r\n\r\n",
